Package: marqdo
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates
Description: Markdown markers as an interpreted programming language
 Marqdo treats Markdown markers as executable syntax (code / return /
 control flow). This package installs the marqdo CLI.
 .
 Official extensions (web, quantum, …) are installed separately via
 "marqdo ext add" and download from https://ext.marqdo.com .
